Z||000007||Black88GT||05-12-2001||05:27 PM||||I had a Fiero catch fire once when my friend and I were towing it.  We left the ebrake on (hey the car was wrecked up front so we didnt think about it) and about 3 miles down the road we heard an explosion, pulled over and the rotor was glowing hot and the hoses were all on fire.||||reg||1
